# ---------------------------------------------------------------- vendored verification tools
# .tools/ holds the software Vulkan driver (Mesa lavapipe) and the Khronos validation
# layers, downloaded locally so the renderer can be verified on a machine with no GPU.
# They are large third-party binaries and must not be committed; the README explains
# how to fetch them.
.tools/*
!.tools/README.md

